## Command Center Sanitization Notes

- `_apply_preset` (wizard or apply): replaces `top_bar_items` + `menu_studio` from preset on save; does not merge prior sidebar config (`sanitize_menu_studio( …, null )`). Runtime `resolve_menu_studio_for_user()` re-merges stored `custom_items` via `merge_saved_custom_menu_items()` when a role preset is assigned.
- `_layout_studio_save` / `_menu_studio_save` markers gate top bar / sidebar writes so other CC pages do not clobber saved layouts.
- Menu Studio save with `use_colors` disabled resets `menu_studio.colors` to defaults (avoids stale custom sidebar colors).
- `_save_custom_preset[name]` appends a new `custom_*` preset from current layout; `_rename_custom_preset[id|name]` renames a saved custom preset label.
- Partial `theme.preset` to a built-in skin clears stale `use_custom_colors` (Dashboard overview AJAX saves omit the legacy flag).
- `apply_preset()` programmatic helper delegates to the same `_apply_preset` sanitize path.

## Partials

- Dashboard: `edminboost-admin-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; includes setup wizard or dashboard overview.
- Appearance: `edminboost-appearance-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; includes `edminboost-theme-settings.php` (with `edminboost-theme-extras-preview.php`) and `edminboost-declutter-settings.php` (with `edminboost-declutter-preview.php`; panel/badge behavior fields moved to Top Bar).
- Top Bar: `edminboost-mapper-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; includes `#edminboost-mapper-look` with `edminboost-home-advanced-look.php` for drawer width, badge style, and animation speed (`command_center.behavior`).
- Settings: `edminboost-settings-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; JSON export/import only (paste or file). CC save forms include hidden `edminboost_settings[enabled]=1` so partial saves do not disable the plugin.
- Feature pages: `edminboost-{productivity,security,performance}-page.php` — include `edminboost-feature-fields.php` with `$section`. Productivity admin-notices fieldset includes `edminboost-productivity-preview.php` (`$preview`: `admin_notices`; `$features`). Performance emoji/assets fieldsets include `edminboost-performance-preview.php` (`$preview`: `emoji`|`assets`; `$features`). Both preview partials use theme colors via `EDMINBOOST_Theme::resolve_preview_colors()`.
- White Label: `edminboost-white-label-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; fields under `white_label`; includes `edminboost-white-label-plugin-preview.php` (`$wl`, `$defaults` from `EDMINBOOST_White_Label::get_plugin_header_defaults()`).
- Billing: `edminboost-billing-page.php` — expects `$cc_settings`, `$current_page`; plans from `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_billing_plans()`.
- Command Center pages: expect `$cc_settings`, `$current_page` (set by `render_command_center_page()`).
- Form actions: `edminboost-form-actions.php` — shared Save + Reset footer; set `$save_label`, `$wrapper_tag` (`p`|`footer`|`div`), `$wrapper_class` before include.
- Setup wizard partials: `edminboost-setup-wizard.php` (includes `edminboost-preset-picker.php`, `edminboost-theme-settings.php`, `edminboost-topbar-summary.php`, `edminboost-setup-review.php`).
- Dashboard overview previews: `edminboost-overview-topbar-preview.php` (`$preview_items`, `$preview_id`, optional `$preview_limit`, `$show_interaction`, `$compact_preview`; icon tips via `__tip` + child `__tooltip` spans, not `title`), `edminboost-overview-sidebar-preview.php` (`$sidebar_items`, `$preview_id`, `$preview_limit`).
- Setting help: call `EDMINBOOST_Setting_Help::echo_icon( $key )` beside labels on non-Dashboard CC/feature pages; checkbox rows put the icon before the input; grouped selects use `.edminboost-select-rows` with one registry key per sub-field when help text differs.
- Document `@var` annotations at the top of partials.

## Docblocks

Document all public methods with `@param`, `@return`, and `@var` on class properties.
